# PocketSmart AI: Your Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

## Project Development Phase

### 1. Introduction

The Project Development Phase is the stage where the PocketSmart AI application is developed based on the requirements and design of the project. The main aim is to create a smart application that helps users manage their money, track expenses, plan budgets, and receive personalized recommendations.

PocketSmart AI helps students and other users make better financial decisions by organizing their income and expenses in one place.

